  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate-smart rural landscape in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected results are to improve the revenues and livelihoods of the population, notably in the Orinoquia basin and more largely in Colombia while reducing their vulnerability to climate change and mitigating their contribution to climate change. The specific objectives are: (i) to support the Green Growth strategy to achieve the fundamental aim of reaching peace in Colombia as well as sustainable development; (ii) to strengthen the cap</narrative>
